      "id": "claim_a46fa81fc472436ba02459f0c102078d",
      "statement": "celld embeds `rusty_v8` directly with one isolate per cell, running actual Durable Objects where `env.NS.get(id).fetch()` instantiates the exported DO class once per id with a `state` whose `storage` is backed by the cell's SQLite.",
